    "AdapterPassword.FreshSessionRejected" : {
      "comment" : "Shown after a password manager rejects a login session it just issued; the placeholder is the password manager’s name, such as Bitwarden",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ hat die bei Ihrer Anmeldung erstellte Sitzung abgelehnt. Daher versucht iTerm2 nicht mehr, sich erneut anzumelden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%@ rejected the session it created when you logged in, so iTerm2 stopped trying to log in again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ がログイン時に作成したセッションを拒否したため、iTerm2 は再ログインの試行を停止しました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@이(가) 로그인할 때 생성한 세션을 거부했으므로 iTerm2가 다시 로그인하려는 시도를 중단했습니다."
